  m_text: I can't quite recall how many antique treasures this family has collected.
    These aren't the ordinary pieces you find everywhere; each one carries a unique
    history, some even with a dark past. Yet, the Hayes family was determined to
    obtain them at any cost. Do they not realize the stories these antiques <color=#FF0000>hold</color>?
    Or are they unaware of the consequences tied to possessing them?
