  m_text: 'I''m terrified... Why does she torment everyone in this mansion? We are
    trapped, tormented by the flow of time, yet no one remembers it. I''m the only
    one who knows the truth, but I am powerless. She''s always watching me, making
    sure I don''t act out of line. If you''re wondering who I am talking about, it''s
    my sister. Her name is -----



    - CC'
