      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Is it <color=#FF0000>3</color>, or perhaps <color=#0000FF>4</color>? Or
    is it just a lie that I\u2019m meant to explore?\nI can't make sense of it\u2014everyone\u2019s
    words are shrouded in deceit.\nAnd then there\u2019s that girl... always smiling,
    even in the shadows.\nSomething about her feels off, as if she\u2019s more dangerous
    than the darkness itself.\n"
